WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.349
There are two quick ways to add work.

00:00:02.349 --> 00:00:06.731
Add takes about ten seconds: name it, pick the subject, set the date.

00:00:06.731 --> 00:00:09.715
Scan lets you take a photo of a homework sheet.

00:00:09.715 --> 00:00:13.779
The app reads it and shows you what it found, under check these.

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.001
Nothing is saved until you say yes.

00:00:16.001 --> 00:00:18.985
So nothing gets lost at the bottom of your bag.

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:21.081
Try it now: scan your next sheet.

